<title>USA: Greenstone to buy back up to 1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Greenstone to buy back up to 1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenstone Roberts Advertising Inc said on Wednesday that it authorized the repurchase of up to one million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Greenstone Roberts said that the current price of the company's stock &quot;does not accurately reflect the present or future value of the company.&quot;</p>
<p>The company, which currently has 7,474,418 shares issued and outstanding, also intends to increase shareholder equity.</p>
<p>Greenstone Roberts is an advertising agency with capital billings of $70 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
